==Strategy==
Despite the restriction, this stage plays out exactly the same as [[Last of the Dead (Merciless)|Last of the Dead]]. Your typical [[Teacher BearCat (Rare Cat)|Cadaver BearCat]], [[Rover Cat (Rare Cat)|Catellite]], [[Wheel Cat (Rare Cat)|Chill Cat]]/[[Cossack Cat (Rare Cat)|Royal Guard Cat]] and [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Jelly Dumpling Cat]] still works here, and the same strategy as before can be used. The only significant difference is your inability to use most [[:Category:Mythic Cats|Mythics]], [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Ubers]] and [[:Category:Legend Rare Cats|Legend Rares]].

